---
import BaseLayout from '../../../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
const locale = 'sw';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Hifadhi na Ghala — Kufuatilia Hisa, Thamani, Maeneo Mengi"
  description="Orodha ya bidhaa, kufuatilia hisa, thamani ya FIFO na uzito wa wastani, risiti za bidhaa, uhamisho, viwango vya kuagiza tena na uhifadhi wa maeneo mengi. Kraal Code ERP."
  locale={locale}
  canonicalUrl="https://kraalcode.com/sw/uwezo/hifadhi/"
>
  <section class="page-hero section--warm"><div class="container">
    <nav class="breadcrumb" aria-label="Njia ya mkate"><ol><li><a href="/sw/">Nyumbani</a></li><li><a href="/sw/uwezo/">Uwezo</a></li><li aria-current="page">Hifadhi na Ghala</li></ol></nav>
    <h1>Hifadhi na Ghala</h1>
    <p class="page-hero-subtext">Jua ulicho nacho, wapi ilipo, gharama yake na wakati wa kuagiza tena. Kitabu kimoja cha hisa, kilichosasishwa kwa wakati halisi katika kila eneo.</p>
  </div></section>

  <section class="section"><div class="container container--narrow">
    <h2>Kwa nani moduli hii</h2>
    <p>Wasimamizi wa ghala, wasimamizi wa duka, maafisa wa ununuzi na viongozi wanaohitaji mwonekano sahihi wa hisa katika maeneo — bila kupatanisha karatasi za hesabu mwishoni mwa mwezi.</p>
    <p>Kama biashara yako inashughulikia bidhaa — kutoka malighafi hadi bidhaa za mwisho — moduli hii inakupa mwonekano kamili wa kila kipande kilicho ghala.</p>
  </div></section>

  <section class="section section--warm"><div class="container">
    <h2>Unachoweza kufanya</h2>
    <div class="feature-grid">
      <div class="feature-card"><h3>Orodha ya Bidhaa</h3><p>Orodha iliyo na vikundi, vipimo, viwango vya kuagiza tena, wauzaji wanaopendelewa na hesabu za GL. Malighafi, bidhaa za mwisho, vifungashio na vya matumizi.</p></div>
      <div class="feature-card"><h3>Thamani ya Hisa</h3><p>Thamani ya hisa kwa FIFO au gharama ya wastani wa uzito. Hesabu upya kwa otomatiki kwa kila upokeaji. Ripoti za thamani kwa bidhaa, kikundi au eneo.</p></div>
      <div class="feature-card"><h3>Risiti za Bidhaa</h3><p>Rekodi za bidhaa zilizopokelewa dhidi ya amri za ununuzi. Kagua idadi na bei. Tofauti zilizopewa alama kwa ukaguzi.</p></div>
      <div class="feature-card"><h3>Ghala za Maeneo Mengi</h3><p>Simamia hisa katika ghala, maduka, viwandani na maeneo ya kusafirisha. Mtazamo kwa eneo au uliopanuliwa. Uhamisho na mzunguko wa uidhinishaji.</p></div>
      <div class="feature-card"><h3>Kufuatilia Kwa Kundi na Muda</h3><p>Fuatilia bidhaa kwa nambari ya kundi na tarehe ya kumalizika. Tumia sheria za FEFO (kwanza kumalizika, kwanza kutoka). Tahadhari za muda wa matumizi.</p></div>
      <div class="feature-card"><h3>Ubadilishaji wa Vipimo</h3><p>Nunua katika masanduku, uza katika vipande, hifadhi katika kilogramu. Injini ya ubadilishaji inabadilisha kati ya vipimo kwa otomatiki.</p></div>
      <div class="feature-card"><h3>Hesabu ya Duka</h3><p>Fanya hesabu ya mara kwa mara bila kusimamisha shughuli. Tofauti za hesabu zinaripotiwa moja kwe moja. Marekebisho ya thamani ya otomatiki.</p></div>
      <div class="feature-card"><h3>Viwango vya Kuagiza Tena</h3><p>Weka viwango vya chini kwa kila bidhaa na eneo. Tahadhari za otomatiki unapofikia kikomo. Omba ununuzi moja kwa moja kutoka kwa tahadhari.</p></div>
    </div>
  </div></section>

  <section class="section"><div class="container container--narrow">
    <h2>Jinsi moduli zinavyoungana</h2>
    <p>Moduli ya hifadhi inaunganishwa na kila moduli inayogusa bidhaa:</p>
    <ul class="connection-list">
      <li><strong>Manunuzi</strong> → hisa inaongezwa unapopokea bidhaa dhidi ya amri za ununuzi</li>
      <li><strong>Mauzo</strong> → hisa inapunguzwa kwa otomatiki unapotoa bidhaa kwa wateja</li>
      <li><strong>Uzalishaji</strong> → malighafi inatolewa na bidhaa za mwisho zinapokelewa kutoka kwa amri za uzalishaji</li>
      <li><strong>Uhasibu</strong> → marekebisho ya thamani ya hisa na gharama za bidhaa zilizouzwa zinaenda kwenye kitabu kikuu</li>
    </ul>
  </div></section>

  <section class="section section--warm"><div class="container container--narrow">
    <h2>Udhibiti na ruhusa</h2>
    <div class="controls-grid">
      <div class="control-item"><h3>Kufunga Kipindi</h3><p>Funga vipindi vya hisa ili kuzuia marekebisho ya nyuma. Fungua tena kwa uidhinishaji uliokaguliwa tu.</p></div>
      <div class="control-item"><h3>Njia ya Ukaguzi</h3><p>Kila muamala wa hisa unarekodiwa: nani, lini, wapi, na thamani gani. INSERT-tu, halibadiliki.</p></div>
      <div class="control-item"><h3>Ruhusa za Eneo</h3><p>Watumiaji wanaweza kusonga au kuuza hisa katika maeneo walioruhusiwa tu. Udhibiti kwa tawi au ghala.</p></div>
      <div class="control-item"><h3>Uidhinishaji wa Uhamisho</h3><p>Uhamisho wa hisa kati ya maeneo unahitaji uidhinishaji. Sanidi vikomo kwa thamani au idadi.</p></div>
    </div>
  </div></section>

  <section class="section"><div class="container">
    <h2>Ona kwa macho</h2>
    <p class="screenshot-intro">Picha kutoka mfumo halisi wa Kraal Code — inakuja hivi karibuni.</p>
    <div class="screenshot-grid">
      <div class="screenshot-slot"><div class="screenshot-placeholder"><span class="screenshot-label">Orodha ya Bidhaa</span><span class="screenshot-note">Picha ya mfumo halisi — inakuja hivi karibuni</span></div></div>
      <div class="screenshot-slot"><div class="screenshot-placeholder"><span class="screenshot-label">Thamani ya Hisa</span><span class="screenshot-note">Picha ya mfumo halisi — inakuja hivi karibuni</span></div></div>
      <div class="screenshot-slot"><div class="screenshot-placeholder"><span class="screenshot-label">Maeneo Mengi</span><span class="screenshot-note">Picha ya mfumo halisi — inakuja hivi karibuni</span></div></div>
      <div class="screenshot-slot"><div class="screenshot-placeholder"><span class="screenshot-label">Hesabu ya Duka</span><span class="screenshot-note">Picha ya mfumo halisi — inakuja hivi karibuni</span></div></div>
    </div>
  </div></section>

  <section class="section--dark section"><div class="container text-center">
    <h2>Ona hifadhi kwa vitendo</h2><p>Oma onyesho lililobinafsishwa kwa mahitaji ya usimamizi wa hisa na ghala.</p>
    <a href="/sw/mawasiliano/" class="btn btn--inverse">Oma Onyesho →</a>
  </div></section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .page-hero{padding:var(--kc-space-20) 0 var(--kc-space-12)}.page-hero h1{font-size:var(--kc-text-4xl);max-width:700px}.page-hero-subtext{font-size:var(--kc-text-lg);color:var(--kc-text-secondary);max-width:60ch;margin-top:var(--kc-space-4)}.breadcrumb ol{list-style:none;padding:0;display:flex;gap:var(--kc-space-2);font-size:var(--kc-text-sm);color:var(--kc-text-tertiary);margin-bottom:var(--kc-space-6)}.breadcrumb a{color:var(--kc-teal);text-decoration:none}.breadcrumb li:not(:last-child)::after{content:'/';margin-left:var(--kc-space-2);color:var(--kc-text-tertiary)}.container--narrow{max-width:var(--kc-container-narrow)}.container--narrow p{font-size:var(--kc-text-base);color:var(--kc-text-secondary);line-height:var(--kc-leading-relaxed);margin-bottom:var(--kc-space-4)}.feature-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);gap:var(--kc-space-6);margin-top:var(--kc-space-8)}.feature-card{padding:var(--kc-space-6);background:var(--kc-surface-light);border:1px solid var(--kc-border-subtle);border-radius:var(--kc-radius-lg)}.feature-card h3{font-size:var(--kc-text-lg);font-family:var(--kc-font-body);font-weight:var(--kc-weight-semibold);margin-bottom:var(--kc-space-2)}.feature-card p{font-size:var(--kc-text-sm);color:var(--kc-text-secondary)}.connection-list{margin-top:var(--kc-space-4)}.connection-list li{margin-bottom:var(--kc-space-3);font-size:var(--kc-text-base);color:var(--kc-text-secondary)}.connection-list strong{color:var(--kc-text-primary)}.controls-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);gap:var(--kc-space-6);margin-top:var(--kc-space-6)}.control-item{padding:var(--kc-space-5);border-left:3px solid var(--kc-teal)}.control-item h3{font-size:var(--kc-text-base);font-family:var(--kc-font-body);font-weight:var(--kc-weight-semibold);margin-bottom:var(--kc-space-1)}.control-item p{font-size:var(--kc-text-sm);color:var(--kc-text-secondary)}.screenshot-intro{color:var(--kc-text-secondary);margin-bottom:var(--kc-space-6)}.screenshot-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);gap:var(--kc-space-6)}.screenshot-slot{aspect-ratio:16/10}.screenshot-placeholder{width:100%;height:100%;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;justify-content:center;background:var(--kc-surface-light);border:2px dashed var(--kc-border-subtle);border-radius:var(--kc-radius-lg);gap:var(--kc-space-2)}.screenshot-label{font-size:var(--kc-text-sm);font-weight:var(--kc-weight-semibold);color:var(--kc-text-primary)}.screenshot-note{font-size:var(--kc-text-xs);color:var(--kc-text-tertiary)}.btn--inverse{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;padding:var(--kc-space-4) var(--kc-space-8);font-weight:var(--kc-weight-semibold);font-size:var(--kc-text-base);border-radius:var(--kc-radius-lg);background:transparent;color:var(--kc-text-inverse);border:2px solid var(--kc-teal-light);transition:all var(--kc-transition-fast);text-decoration:none;margin-top:var(--kc-space-6)}.btn--inverse:hover{background:var(--kc-teal);border-color:var(--kc-teal)}@media(max-width:768px){.page-hero h1{font-size:var(--kc-text-3xl)}.feature-grid,.controls-grid,.screenshot-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}}
</style>
